# Green Ward gives Bot2's Savannah Lions protection from green (CR 702.16). On turn 3 Bot1 cannot target the Lions with
# Rancor, a green Aura spell (CR 702.16b; the refusal, and the runner offers it again with mana to spare), and Grizzly
# Bears attacking into it is blocked by the Lions: the Bears' damage is green and prevented (CR 702.16e), so the 2/1
# Lions survives with no damage marked (without Green Ward it would die) while the Bears die.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Grizzly Bears
Rancor
Forest
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Savannah Lions
Green Ward
Plains x12

